{"person":"person:canon:youtanzhi","as_name":"庄聚贤","kind":"false_identity","when":null,"where":"place:canon:shaoshishan","believed_by":["*"],"ch":[41,41],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[41,23,317,331,"2e74a16864eb8ca0"],[41,41,18,37,"1c8adf0cece6595a"]],"note":"面上覆人皮面具，用庄聚贤的名号当上丐帮新首领；全冠清知情，阿紫、丁春秋、乔峰与少林一方皆不知其真名；面具后被乔峰一拳击碎"}
{"person":"person:canon:youtanzhi","as_name":"铁头人","kind":"alias","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":[],"ch":[41,41],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[41,67,19,30,"ba9a1981d11f6d46"],[41,111,54,65,"b1c8104a931b16b9"]],"note":"先前头戴铁罩时的称呼；丁春秋听出声音相似却不信是同一人，乔峰探得阿紫身边有此人"}
{"person":"person:canon:ruanxingzhu","as_name":"男装","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":"place:canon:shaoshishan","believed_by":[],"ch":[41,41],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[41,22,65,75,"6bb2c411a303df24"]],"note":"她改穿男装混在大理一行中，一声呼唤阿紫便露出女子本音"}
